## Tool Compatibility

Codex, GitHub Copilot, and Cursor read this file directly. Tools with a
different default filename need a link or an import:

```bash
ln -s AGENTS.md CLAUDE.md   # Claude Code; or a CLAUDE.md holding @AGENTS.md
ln -s AGENTS.md GEMINI.md   # Gemini CLI; or add AGENTS.md to context.fileName
```

Aider discovers no file. Load this one with `aider --read AGENTS.md`, or set
`read: AGENTS.md` in `.aider.conf.yml`.
